    "处理中再按快捷键不会开始新的录音，按 Esc 可以取消。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pressing the shortcut while processing won't start a new recording; press Esc to cancel."
          }
